    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054450/extras/f35f351a1478ae63daecd6419c89f56f.avif?t=1728542009\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br>The Vast and Boundless World of Virtual Photography<br>From the bustling modern metropolis to the tranquil ancient courtyards, every exploration brings new inspiration and a sense of achievement. Whether you are a virtual photography enthusiast or a video editing expert, this place can satisfy your infinite desire for beauty and creativity.<br><br>-Free character selection<br>Freedom to choose roles. Whether it's modern fashion or antique elegance, showcase your unique style through a wide range of choices.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054450/extras/31dcd4fe45d286436705458262c70474.avif?t=1728542009\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br>Rich Scene Selection<br>A variety of meticulously designed scenes provide endless inspiration for your creations. The specially designed green screen scenes offer infinite possibilities for custom creation, letting your inspiration run wild.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054450/extras/22be55cb8c1d529e35f6cff3720a33d8.avif?t=1728542009\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br>Diverse Actions and Effects<br>A variety of actions and dazzling effects can be freely combined, making your photos more dynamic and visually impactful.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054450/extras/a33dafd64e2a383a282726c3b357ae17.avif?t=1728542009\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054450/extras/5d174d47c84609502c2dc